window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Someone is killing the Hollows in New Orleans. After freeing the city from the yoke of Remy, the immortal Madison and her coven start building a new social system based on freedom and democracy. But years of relying on the protection offered by a dictator has made the witches soft. Now their sacred spaces are under attack, and dangerous entities are slipping into the city. As Madison investigates further, she finds a group of imps responsible for the draining and destruction of a Hollow and foils their plans to continue pillaging. But this is only the beginning. When a group of demon-bloods spill into town hell-bent on taking what they want and answering to no one, the witches of New Orleans have to scramble just to react. Throw a tall, abrasive new distraction hiding a dark secret into the mix, and this witch has her hands full. Every decision Madison makes could lead to catastrophe, and with so many lives hanging in the balance, she can't afford to make any mistakes. But without Jean Luc and Eliza by her side, she just might. </p>"; 
